    "title": "Man arrested for felony drug - weapon crimes - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WDELNews ,\n18 hours ago A Wilmington man is behind bars following an investigation into drugs and weapons. Delaware State Police said a search warrant was carried out at the suspect's residence in the 400-block of Carver Drive Monday. The search turned up 174 grams of suspected cocaine, four firearms - one of which was reported stolen - some ammunition, a digital scale and other drug paraphernalia. Read full article\n3",
